{"unit_id":"scclovez__dsh-tun-proxy#feature-subscription","repo":"scclovez/dsh-tun-proxy","commit":"64efd538bbbee3b00b6d303a44c40c7028469395","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 代理中心的功能「订阅管理」：导入 Clash/mihomo 订阅或节点分享链接，保存配置并刷新远程订阅。可在工具中导入、更新和管理多个订阅。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core/profiles.js:59-89","lib/tools.js:159-168"]}
