{"unit_id":"scclovez__dsh-tun-proxy#feature-tun","repo":"scclovez/dsh-tun-proxy","commit":"64efd538bbbee3b00b6d303a44c40c7028469395","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 代理中心的功能「TUN 代理控制」：启动 mihomo 并按当前设置生成配置，可开启 TUN 将电脑流量经代理转发；也可停止内核恢复直连。通过 start 和 stop 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:104-134"]}
{"unit_id":"scclovez__dsh-tun-proxy#feature-chain","repo":"scclovez/dsh-tun-proxy","commit":"64efd538bbbee3b00b6d303a44c40c7028469395","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 代理中心的功能「多跳代理链」：按入口到出口设置 2 至 8 个节点，生成 TCP 链式配置并应用；不支持的 UDP 流量会被拒绝。通过链路工具设置并应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:202-222","lib/core/chain.js:44-70"]}
